; Heat and Retract 5mm filament
M104 S200       ; Start heating hotend to 200°C (non-blocking)
M109 S200       ; Wait until hotend reaches 200°C
G92 E0          ; Reset extruder position to 0
G1 E-5 F300      ; Extrude 5mm of filament at 5 mm/s
G4 S10          ; Wait 10 seconds (to observe extrusion or allow extra melt time)
M104 S0         ; Turn off hotend heater for safety
